Package: MBRarefy
Type: Package
Title: MBRarefy: data-adaptive library-size binning and multibin rarefaction for alpha diversity association analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
    given = "Mo",
    family = "Li",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "mo.li@louisiana.edu"
    )
  )
Description: This package implements multibin rarefaction for alpha-diversity analysis under heterogeneous library sizes. The package provides data-adaptive selection of library-size bin thresholds, within-bin rarefaction to bin-specific depths, and estimation and association testing of alpha-diversity metrics with optional covariate adjustment. Tools are included for reproducible workflows, diagnostics, and summary reporting for sequencing-based community profiling data (e.g., microbiome, metagenomics, TCR immune repertoire).
